; Six cards a segment in (kind, inh, mn, pms, vls, s), two out (x, base): the segment will last x pr / 100 + base
; ms, pr from Klatt's rules (mul.cq). x = INHDUR - MINDUR and base = MINDUR, MINDUR halved when the segment is
; unstressed (rule 7, (5 mn) / 10); a stressed vowel or sonorant right after P T K gets 25 ms more (rule 11). A
; pause lasts its own length: x 0, base its ms.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   kind     03-16: a segment; a pause
  04                    INP   inh
  05                    INP   mn
  06                    INP   pms
  07                    INP   vls
  08                    INP   s
  09                    CLA   kind
  10                    SUB   c8
  11                    TAC   sound
  12                    OUT   z
  13                    OUT   pms
  14                    CLA   z
  15                    STO   pvls
  16                    JMP   rec
  17            sound   CLA   s        17-27: unstressed: MINDUR halved
  18                    SUB   00
  19                    TAC   half
  20                    JMP   bas
  21            half    CLA   mn
  22                    ADD   mn
  23                    ADD   mn
  24                    ADD   mn
  25                    ADD   mn
  26                    SFT   01
  27                    STO   mn
  28            bas     CLA   mn       28-42: rule 11
  29                    STO   base
  30                    CLA   s
  31                    SUB   00
  32                    TAC   outb
  33                    CLA   kind
  34                    SUB   n3
  35                    TAC   k12
  36                    JMP   outb
  37            k12     CLA   pvls
  38                    SUB   00
  39                    TAC   outb
  40                    CLA   base
  41                    ADD   c25
  42                    STO   base
  43            outb    CLA   inh      43-50: x and base out
  44                    SUB   mn
  45                    STO   x
  46                    OUT   x
  47                    OUT   base
  48                    CLA   vls
  49                    STO   pvls
  50                    JMP   rec
  60            kind    DATA  0
  61            inh     DATA  0
  62            mn      DATA  0
  63            pms     DATA  0
  64            vls     DATA  0
  65            s       DATA  0
  66            pvls    DATA  0
  67            base    DATA  0
  68            x       DATA  0
  69            z       DATA  0
  70            c8      DATA  8
  71            n3      DATA  3
  72            c25     DATA  25
